      h2 Name# @297,687,137,21
      text When referring to Pico CSS, the correct brand name is “Pico CSS”. You can also use “Pico” or “Pico ✨” if you prefer. @297,720,137,142
      text The CSS stylesheet can be referred as “pico.css”. However, please avoid using “PicoCss”, “PicoCSS”, “Pico.css”, or “pico”. @297,874,137,183
      h2 Usage agreement# @297,1069,137,42
      text Pico CSS brand name and logo are protected under intellectual property law. @297,1123,137,102
      text You can use the Pico CSS name as part of the name of your open-source and non-commercial project, such as “Pico-React”, but using the name in commercial projects without permission is not allowed. @297,1237,137,223
      text You cannot use the Pico CSS logo for open or closed source projects, but you’re welcome to use it in articles or documentation as long as proper credit is given. @297,1472,137,183
      text The use of the Pico CSS brand name and logo on merchandise, such as t-shirts or stickers, requires explicit written consent. @297,1667,137,162
